{"turn_id": "d03-t1", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size", "text": "FEVER is described as the largest dataset, containing around 185k claims drawn from a corpus of 5.4M Wikipedia articles.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_labels", "text": "The claims are labeled as “SUPPORTS”, “REFUTES”, or “NOT ENOUGH INFO”, based on the evidence set.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_labels", "text": "FEVER 数据集中的声明根据证据集被标注为“SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "paper_approach", "text": "该论文提出一种无监督的问答式方法来解决事实核查问题，将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze 任务，即掩码声明中提供的命名实体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "label_coverage", "text": "该分类器目前只能将声明分类为“SUPPORTS”和“MANUAL_REVIEW”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "manual_review_rationale", "text": "由于声明核查过程与问题生成过程均不要求显式推理，难以赋予“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”标签，因此作者将不受支持的声明归类为“MANUAL_REVIEW”，而不是标注为“NOT ENOUGH INFO”或“REFUTES”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-c1927faa43ced5496949efab"}]}, {"key": "accuracy_results", "text": "该方法在转换后数据集的开发集上达到 80.2% 的标签准确率，在测试集上达到 80.25%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "pipeline_stages", "text": "该流程包含三个阶段：(1) 问题生成（类似 Cloze 任务），(2) 问题回答，(3) 标签分类。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "question_generation_accuracy", "text": "问题生成任务在将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze 任务时达到近 90% 的准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "threshold_interpretation", "text": "phi = 0.76 表示 4 个问题中至少 3 个必须被正确回答，而 phi = 0.67 表示 3 个问题中至少 2 个必须被正确回答，声明才会被分类为“SUPPORTS”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "comparable_to_hexaf", "text": "该无监督模型虽不支持所有标签，但其对“SUPPORTS”标签的标签准确率在 phi = 0.76 时与监督方法 HexaF 相当。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
